<SiteLayout title="Our Story — Just Okinawa" description="An independent journal about the islands and everyday moments of Okinawa."><div class="wrap"><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE ISLANDS. THE EVERYDAY.</span><h1>Just Okinawa.<br/><em>Just as it feels.</em></h1></header><section class="content-section prose"><p>Just Okinawa is an independent English-language journal about the places, flavors and everyday moments that make these islands special.</p><p>We believe a good journey leaves room for small discoveries: a quiet street, a local meal, a view that makes you put your phone away.</p><h2>Look a little closer.</h2><p>This journal brings travel inspiration and practical starting points together. Explore an island, follow a feeling, or read the latest stories and see where they take you.</p><p>For changing travel details, always check the linked official sources and service providers before you go.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read the journal ↗</a></section></div></SiteLayout>
